---
// Tabbed care guide: tabs > columns > column > accordion > item > card > button.
---

<section id="page-builder-six-deep" class="section guide guide--warm">
  <!-- kit: page-builder-six-deep -->
  <span id="care-guide" class="guide__anchor" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">Care guide</span>
      <h2>Cast iron, start to finish.</h2>
      <p class="lead">Season it once over fire, cook in it every day, bring it back from anything. Everything we teach in the workshop, in three tabs.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="tabs tabs--underline">
      <div class="tabs__list" role="tablist" aria-label="Care guide">
        <button class="tabs__tab" role="tab" id="pb6-tab-1" aria-controls="pb6-panel-1" aria-selected="true" tabindex="0">Seasoning</button>
        <button class="tabs__tab" role="tab" id="pb6-tab-2" aria-controls="pb6-panel-2" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">Cooking</button>
        <button class="tabs__tab" role="tab" id="pb6-tab-3" aria-controls="pb6-panel-3" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">Restoring</button>
      </div>

      <!-- Tab 1: Seasoning -->
      <div class="tabs__panel" role="tabpanel" id="pb6-panel-1" aria-labelledby="pb6-tab-1" tabindex="0">
        <div class="cols cols--wide-left cols--gap-lg">
          <div class="cols__col cols__col--top">
            <div class="acc acc--lined">
              <h3 class="acc__heading">Season over fire in four steps</h3>
              <details class="acc__item" name="pb6-ac1" open>
                <summary>
                  <span class="acc__title">Scrub it back</span>
                  <span class="acc__summary">Hot water and a chainmail scrubber. No soap needed.</span>
                </summary>
                <article class="acc-card">
                  <img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/chainmail-scrub/1600/1000" alt="A chainmail scrubber working over a wet skillet" width="3200" height="2000" loading="lazy" />
                  <div class="acc-card__body">
                    <span class="acc-card__eyebrow">Step 1</span>
                    <h4>Start with a bare, dry pan</h4>
                    <p>Scrub under hot water until the surface feels even, then dry it over the flame for two minutes so no water hides in the pores.</p>
                    <a class="link-arrow" href="/products/chainmail-scrubber" title="Chainmail scrubber">Shop the scrubber <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
                  </div>
                </article>
              </details>
              <details class="acc__item" name="pb6-ac1">
                <summary>
                  <span class="acc__title">Oil, then wipe it off</span>
                  <span class="acc__summary">The thinnest coat of flaxseed oil you can manage.</span>
                </summary>
                <article class="acc-card">
                  <img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/flax-wipe/1600/1000" alt="A lint-free cloth wiping oil from a warm skillet" width="3200" height="2000" loading="lazy" />
                  <div class="acc-card__body">
                    <span class="acc-card__eyebrow">Step 2</span>
                    <h4>Thin coats, every time</h4>
                    <p>Rub in half a teaspoon, then wipe as if you made a mistake. Thick oil turns sticky instead of hard.</p>
                    <a class="link-arrow" href="/journal/seasoning-cast-iron-open-fire" title="Seasoning cast iron over an open fire">Why flaxseed <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
                  </div>
                </article>
              </details>
              <details class="acc__item" name="pb6-ac1">
                <summary>
                  <span class="acc__title">Heat it upside down</span>
                  <span class="acc__summary">45 minutes over medium coals.</span>
                </summary>
                <article class="acc-card">
                  <img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/upside-down-coals/1600/1000" alt="A skillet upside down on the Cable Fold grate above glowing coals" width="3200" height="2000" loading="lazy" />
                  <div class="acc-card__body">
                    <span class="acc-card__eyebrow">Step 3</span>
                    <h4>Let the fire do the work</h4>
                    <p>Set the pan face down on the grate over medium coals. Smoke means it's working; keep going until it stops, about 45 minutes.</p>
                    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/products/cable-fold" title="Cable Fold Grill">Shop the Cable Fold <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
                  </div>
                </article>
              </details>
              <details class="acc__item" name="pb6-ac1">
                <summary>
                  <span class="acc__title">Repeat three times</span>
                  <span class="acc__summary">Then fry eggs for a week.</span>
                </summary>
                <article class="acc-card acc-card--no-image">
                  <div class="acc-card__body">
                    <span class="acc-card__eyebrow">Step 4</span>
                    <h4>Three coats, then cook</h4>
                    <p>Three rounds builds a surface that releases an egg on the first try. Daily cooking does the rest.</p>
                    <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/journal/seasoning-cast-iron-open-fire#film">Watch the full method</a>
                  </div>
                </article>
              </details>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="cols__col cols__col--top">
            <figure class="img-block img-block--cover">
              <img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/seasoning-kit/900/1100" alt="Flaxseed oil, a cloth and a scrubber laid out on a wooden board" width="1800" height="2200" loading="lazy" />
              <figcaption>The seasoning kit, $24</figcaption>
            </figure>
            <div class="cta-card cta-card--solid" style="--tone: #F6F1EA">
              <h3>Everything for step one</h3>
              <p>Oil, cloth and a scrubber in one tin.</p>
              <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/products/seasoning-kit" title="Seasoning kit">Shop the kit <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="text-block">
          <h3>Already seasoned?</h3>
          <p>Every Caldera pan ships with three coats. You can skip straight to the Cooking tab.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Tab 2: Cooking -->
      <div class="tabs__panel" role="tabpanel" id="pb6-panel-2" aria-labelledby="pb6-tab-2" tabindex="0" hidden>
        <div class="cols cols--even cols--gap-md">
          <div class="cols__col cols__col--top">
            <div class="acc acc--boxed">
              <h3 class="acc__heading">Your first week</h3>
              <details class="acc__item">
                <summary><span class="acc__title">Day 1: fried eggs</span></summary>
                <article class="acc-card acc-card--no-image">
                  <div class="acc-card__body">
                    <h4>Butter, medium heat, patience</h4>
                    <p>Preheat for five minutes. If the butter browns at once, it's too hot.</p>
                    <a class="link-arrow" href="/recipes/campfire-eggs">Get the recipe <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
                  </div>
                </article>
              </details>
              <details class="acc__item">
                <summary><span class="acc__title">Day 3: smash burgers</span></summary>
                <article class="acc-card acc-card--no-image">
                  <div class="acc-card__body">
                    <h4>Ripping hot, no oil</h4>
                    <p>The fat renders and seasons the pan for you.</p>
                    <a class="link-arrow" href="/recipes/smash-burgers">Get the recipe <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
                  </div>
                </article>
              </details>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="cols__col cols__col--center">
            <div class="stat-block">
              <span class="stat-block__value">900&deg;F</span>
              <span class="stat-block__label">Safe up to</span>
            </div>
            <figure class="quote-block">
              <div class="stars" role="img" aria-label="Rated 5 out of 5">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>
              <blockquote>
                <p>By day five my eggs slid like they were on Teflon.</p>
              </blockquote>
              <figcaption><strong>Maya Reyes</strong><span>Backcountry guide, Montana</span></figcaption>
            </figure>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Tab 3: Restoring -->
      <div class="tabs__panel" role="tabpanel" id="pb6-panel-3" aria-labelledby="pb6-tab-3" tabindex="0" hidden>
        <div class="video-block">
          <h3>Bringing back a rusted skillet</h3>
          <div class="video-frame" data-embed="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/aqz-KE-bpKQ?autoplay=1">
            <img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/rust-restore/1600/1000" alt="A rusted skillet beside the same skillet restored" width="3200" height="2000" loading="lazy" />
            <button class="video-frame__play" type="button" aria-label="Play video: Bringing back a rusted skillet">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="28" height="28" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z" fill="currentColor" /></svg>
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="acc acc--lined">
          <h3 class="acc__heading">Fix it yourself</h3>
          <details class="acc__item" name="pb6-ac3">
            <summary><span class="acc__title">Orange rust spots</span></summary>
            <article class="acc-card acc-card--no-image">
              <div class="acc-card__body">
                <h4>Steel wool, then season</h4>
                <p>Scrub to grey metal, rinse, dry over the fire and give it one coat.</p>
                <a class="link-arrow" href="/products/seasoning-kit">Care kit <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
              </div>
            </article>
          </details>
          <details class="acc__item" name="pb6-ac3">
            <summary><span class="acc__title">Sticky surface</span></summary>
            <article class="acc-card acc-card--no-image">
              <div class="acc-card__body">
                <h4>Too much oil</h4>
                <p>Bake it off: 45 minutes upside down over high coals, then one thin coat.</p>
              </div>
            </article>
          </details>
          <details class="acc__item" name="pb6-ac3">
            <summary><span class="acc__title">A crack</span></summary>
            <article class="acc-card acc-card--no-image">
              <div class="acc-card__body">
                <h4>That's on us</h4>
                <p>Cracks are covered for life. Send a photo and we'll ship a new one.</p>
                <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/warranty" title="Warranty">Start a warranty claim <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
              </div>
            </article>
          </details>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  {
    const root = document.getElementById("page-builder-six-deep");
    if (root) {
      const tabs = Array.from(root.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[role="tab"]'));
      const select = (tab: HTMLButtonElement) => {
        tabs.forEach((t) => {
          const on = t === tab;
          t.setAttribute("aria-selected", String(on));
          t.tabIndex = on ? 0 : -1;
          const panel = root.querySelector<HTMLElement>("#" + t.getAttribute("aria-controls"));
          if (panel) panel.hidden = !on;
        });
      };
      tabs.forEach((tab, i) => {
        tab.addEventListener("click", () => select(tab));
        tab.addEventListener("keydown", (e) => {
          let next = -1;
          if (e.key === "ArrowRight") next = (i + 1) % tabs.length;
          if (e.key === "ArrowLeft") next = (i - 1 + tabs.length) % tabs.length;
          if (e.key === "Home") next = 0;
          if (e.key === "End") next = tabs.length - 1;
          if (next > -1) {
            e.preventDefault();
            tabs[next].focus();
            select(tabs[next]);
          }
        });
      });
      root.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>(".video-frame").forEach((frame) => {
        frame.querySelector("button")?.addEventListener("click", () => {
          const iframe = document.createElement("iframe");
          iframe.src = frame.dataset.embed || "";
          iframe.title = "Bringing back a rusted skillet";
          iframe.allow = "autoplay; encrypted-media; picture-in-picture";
          iframe.allowFullscreen = true;
          frame.replaceChildren(iframe);
        });
      });
    }
  }
</script>

<style>
  .guide--warm {
    background: #f6f1ea;
  }
  .guide {
    position: relative;
  }
  .guide__anchor {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
  }
  .tabs__list {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.25rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    overflow-x: auto;
    scrollbar-width: none;
  }
  .tabs__tab {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    min-height: 44px;
    padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
    border: 0;
    border-bottom: 2px solid transparent;
    margin-bottom: -1px;
    background: none;
    font: inherit;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--ink-2);
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .tabs__tab[aria-selected="true"] {
    color: var(--ink);
    border-bottom-color: var(--brand);
  }
  .tabs__panel {
    display: grid;
    gap: 2rem;
  }
  .tabs__panel[hidden] {
    display: none;
  }
  .cols {
    display: grid;
    gap: 2.5rem;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
  }
  .cols--gap-md {
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .cols--wide-left {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 2fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
    .cols--even {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }
  .cols__col {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    align-content: start;
  }
  .cols__col--center {
    align-content: center;
  }
  .acc__heading {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .acc__item {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .acc--lined .acc__item:last-child {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .acc--boxed {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }
  .acc--boxed .acc__item {
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: var(--bg);
    padding-inline: 1rem;
  }
  .acc__item summary {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.125rem;
    padding: 1rem 2rem 1rem 0;
    cursor: pointer;
    list-style: none;
    position: relative;
  }
  .acc__item summary::-webkit-details-marker {
    display: none;
  }
  .acc__item summary::after {
    content: "+";
    position: absolute;
    right: 0.25rem;
    top: 0.9rem;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--ink-3);
  }
  .acc__item[open] summary::after {
    content: "\2212";
  }
  .acc__title {
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .acc__summary {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }
  .acc-card {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    padding: 1rem;
    background: var(--bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
  }
  .acc--boxed .acc-card {
    border: 0;
    padding: 0 0 0.25rem;
  }
  @media (min-width: 600px) {
    .acc-card:not(.acc-card--no-image) {
      grid-template-columns: 200px minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
  }
  .acc-card img {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 10;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
  }
  .acc-card__eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--brand);
  }
  .acc-card h4 {
    margin: 0.25rem 0 0.375rem;
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
  }
  .acc-card p {
    color: var(--ink-2);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
  }
  .link-arrow {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--brand);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .link-arrow:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  .img-block {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .img-block img {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 9 / 11;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
  }
  .img-block figcaption {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }
  .cta-card {
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: var(--tone);
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--ink) 10%, transparent);
  }
  .cta-card p {
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }
  .text-block {
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--brand);
    background: var(--bg);
    border-radius: 0 var(--radius) var(--radius) 0;
  }
  .text-block p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }
  .stat-block {
    display: grid;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background: var(--dark);
    color: var(--dark-ink);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
  }
  .stat-block__value {
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 3.5rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }
  .stat-block__label {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--dark-ink) 75%, transparent);
  }
  .quote-block {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background: var(--bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
  }
  .stars {
    color: var(--warning);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }
  .quote-block blockquote {
    margin: 0.5rem 0 1rem;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .quote-block figcaption {
    display: grid;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
  }
  .quote-block figcaption span {
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }
  .video-block h3 {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .video-frame {
    position: relative;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--dark);
  }
  .video-frame img,
  .video-frame :global(iframe) {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    border: 0;
  }
  .video-frame__play {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 50% auto auto 50%;
    translate: -50% -50%;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 72px;
    height: 72px;
    border: 0;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--brand);
    color: var(--brand-ink);
    cursor: pointer;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  }
</style>
